module proof_observed_memory
lineage L_A
agent A lineage L_A
observe event by A content "sensor-A-observed-event" confidence 0.98
proof p_access access event by A
proof p_origin origin event source A lineage L_A
proof p_clear clear event for A
proof p_observation observation event by A
proof p_ownership ownership event by A as observed from ["p_access","p_origin","p_clear","p_observation"]
write_memory event by A as observed requires p_ownership
assert proof p_ownership valid true
assert memory A contains event as observed true
